cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the associated manuscript, please cite it as below."
title: "Depth-Recycled Recurrent Diffusion for Long-Context Agent Workloads"
abstract: >-
  Code, machine-checked contracts and hash-bound receipts for a study of whether
  depth recycling improves long-context behaviour in a non-latent, bidirectionally
  scanned recurrent diffusion model, or merely spends compute. The confirmatory
  endpoints are registered and not yet measured; the repository states that
  explicitly rather than filling the cells, and the manuscript should not be cited
  for an effect size.
type: software
authors:
  # `name` rather than given/family split: the repository's only recorded author
  # identity is the GitHub handle, and splitting it would be guessing at how the
  # author writes their own name.
  - name: "Joshua-Zhang-Jiaquan"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Joshua-Zhang-Jiaquan/Long-RWKV"
url: "https://github.com/Joshua-Zhang-Jiaquan/Long-RWKV"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-16"
keywords:
  - diffusion language models
  - recurrent neural networks
  - RWKV
  - long-context
  - depth recycling
  - reproducibility
# NOTE: no `license:` or `license-url:` field is set, deliberately.
# The repository carries no LICENSE file and the licence has NOT been chosen, so
# declaring one here would assert terms the author has not granted. Adding the
# field is a one-line change once the licence is decided.
